{"title": "Feline Fall", "pageid": 10782, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Feline_Fall", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters", "Racial features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Slow_Fall.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Slow_Fall.webp/300px-Slow_Fall.webp, /w/images/6/6a/Slow_Fall.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Slow_Fall.webp/300px-Slow_Fall.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Slow_Fall.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Feline Fall</b> is a passive feature in Baldur's Gate 3 that grants a creature the ability to resist falling damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Due to their natural feline grace, cats are <a href=\"/wiki/Resistant\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistant\">Resistant</a> to Falling damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Barsik\" title=\"Barsik\">Barsik</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cat\" title=\"Cat\">Cat</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cat_(wild_shape)\" title=\"Cat (wild shape)\">Cat (wild shape)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Conjured_Cat\" title=\"Conjured Cat\">Conjured Cat</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Grub\" title=\"Grub\">Grub</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/His_Majesty\" title=\"His Majesty\">His Majesty</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kira\" title=\"Kira\">Kira</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Malta\" title=\"Malta\">Malta</a>,  <a hre